@startuml credits-invoice
title Invoicing with credits

participant "Billing provider\nbackend" as Backend
participant "Payment processor" as Payments
participant "Billing provider\ncontrollers" as Provider
participant "Milo API server" as Milo
actor Customer

== End of the billing period ==
Backend -> Backend : price the period's usage: $90
Backend -> Backend : apply available credit: $50\n(soonest-expiring grant first)
Backend -> Backend : invoice: total $90,\ncredits $50, due $40
Backend -> Payments : charge $40 to the payment method\n(or send the invoice for invoice terms)
Backend -> Backend : record the $50 as used\n(booked balance drops)

== Projection ==
Provider -> Backend : the account's invoices (resync)
Backend --> Provider : total 90, credits 50, amount due 40
Provider -> Milo : Invoice status: total 90,\ncreditsApplied 50, amountDue 40
Customer -> Milo : list Invoices (cloud-portal)
Milo --> Customer : $90 of usage, $50 credit, $40 charged

note over Backend, Payments : an invoice fully covered by credit\nhas amountDue 0: nothing is charged
@enduml
